<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es-MX">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Dashboard AVM — Estimador de precio de vivienda</title>
<meta name="description" content="Dashboard de apoyo a la decisión inmobiliaria: AVM, plusvalía y tendencia SHF.">
</head>
<body>

<style>
h2.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0)}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:2px;border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1.25rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.tab{padding:7px 14px;font-size:13px;background:none;border:none;color:var(--text-secondary);cursor:pointer;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;margin-bottom:-1px;white-space:nowrap}
.tab.active{color:var(--text-primary);border-bottom-color:var(--text-primary);font-weight:500}
.panel{display:none}.panel.active{display:block}
.metric-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(118px,1fr));gap:8px;margin-bottom:1.1rem}
.metric{background:var(--surface-1);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:11px 13px}
.metric-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:3px}
.metric-val{font-size:19px;font-weight:500}
.metric-sub{font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:2px}
.card{background:var(--surface-2);border:0.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:.9rem 1.1rem;margin-bottom:.9rem}
.card-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:.8rem;color:var(--text-primary)}
label{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:3px}
.form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px;margin-bottom:9px}
input[type=number],input[type=text],select{width:100%;font-size:13px}
input[type=range]{width:100%}
.btn-primary{width:100%;margin-top:4px;padding:9px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;background:var(--text-primary);color:var(--surface-2);border:none;border-radius:var(--radius);cursor:pointer}
.btn-primary:active{opacity:.85}
.result-panel{display:none;margin-top:10px}
.result-hero{background:var(--surface-1);border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:8px}
.result-precio{font-size:30px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-primary)}
.result-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-top:3px}
.result-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px}
.result-card{border-radius:var(--radius);padding:10px 12px}
.result-card.val{background:var(--bg-success)}
.result-card.crec{background:var(--bg-accent)}
.result-card.warn{background:var(--bg-warning)}
.result-card .rc-label{font-size:10px;margin-bottom:2px}
.result-card.val .rc-label{color:var(--text-success)}
.result-card.crec .rc-label{color:var(--text-accent)}
.result-card.warn .rc-label{color:var(--text-warning)}
.result-card .rc-val{font-size:17px;font-weight:500}
.result-card.val .rc-val{color:var(--text-success)}
.result-card.crec .rc-val{color:var(--text-accent)}
.result-card.warn .rc-val{color:var(--text-warning)}
.warn-box{background:var(--bg-warning);border:0.5px solid var(--border-warning);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:8px 11px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-warning);margin-top:8px}
.bar-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:11px}
.bar-label{color:var(--text-secondary);width:148px;flex-shrink:0;text-align:right;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.bar-track{flex:1;background:var(--surface-1);border-radius:3px;height:11px;overflow:hidden}
.bar-fill{height:100%;border-radius:3px}
.bar-val{color:var(--text-primary);font-weight:500;min-width:44px;font-size:11px}
.two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
.modelo-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:5px;font-size:11px;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--border);align-items:center}
.modelo-row.header{font-weight:500;color:var(--text-secondary)}
.best-row{background:var(--bg-success);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:7px 8px}
.badge-b{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--bg-success);color:var(--text-success)}
.low{color:var(--text-success)}.mid{color:var(--text-warning)}.high{color:var(--text-danger)}
.map-wrap{position:relative;width:100%;background:var(--surface-1);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;min-height:280px}
.map-toggle{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-bottom:8px}
.map-toggle button{padding:5px 11px;font-size:11px;border:0.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);background:none;color:var(--text-secondary);cursor:pointer}
.map-toggle button.active{background:var(--text-primary);color:var(--surface-2);border-color:var(--text-primary)}
.legend-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;font-size:10px;color:var(--text-secondary)}
.leg-grad{height:9px;width:100px;border-radius:3px}
.mtooltip{position:absolute;background:var(--surface-2);border:0.5px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:8px 11px;font-size:11px;pointer-events:none;display:none;z-index:10;color:var(--text-primary);min-width:150px;line-height:1.6}
.zm-pill{display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:var(--radius);font-size:11px;margin:2px;border:0.5px solid var(--border);color:var(--text-secondary);cursor:default}
.coord-row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:9px}
.coord-row input{flex:1}
.loc-indicator{display:none;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-accent);margin-top:4px}

/* Mapa de ubicación */
.location-map-card{margin-top:12px}
#location-map{width:100%;height:520px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface-1)}
.location-map-toolbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.location-coords{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-secondary)}
.btn-secondary{padding:6px 11px;font-size:11px;border:.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);background:none;color:var(--text-secondary);cursor:pointer}
.btn-secondary:hover{background:var(--surface-1)}
@media(max-width:700px){#location-map{height:400px}.result-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

/* ======== DISEÑO EJECUTIVO / REPORTE ======== */
:root{
  --bg-primary:#ffffff;--surface-1:#f4f5f7;--surface-2:#ffffff;--text-primary:#111827;--text-secondary:#6b7280;--text-muted:#9ca3af;--border:#e5e7eb;--border-strong:#cbd5e1;--bg-success:#e9f8f1;--text-success:#087f5b;--bg-accent:#edf4ff;--text-accent:#2563eb;--bg-warning:#fff7df;--text-warning:#a16207;--text-danger:#dc2626;--border-warning:#f0d27a;--radius:8px;
  --report-bg:#f0f2f5;
  --report-card:#ffffff;
  --report-border:#e2e5ea;
  --report-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(15,23,42,.08);
}
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
body{font-family:'Inter',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif}
.tabs{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:30;background:var(--surface-2);padding-top:6px}
.tab{transition:.2s ease}
.tab:hover{color:var(--text-primary);background:var(--surface-1);border-radius:8px 8px 0 0}

/* Shell principal */
.report-shell{background:var(--report-bg);border-radius:0;padding:0;overflow:hidden}

/* Header ejecutivo con degradado oscuro */
.report-head{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a 0%,#1e3a5f 60%,#1d4ed8 100%);
  padding:28px 28px 24px;
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:20px;
  margin-bottom:0;
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.report-head::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:-60px;right:-60px;
  width:220px;height:220px;border-radius:50%;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);pointer-events:none;
}
.report-head::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-80px;right:80px;
  width:160px;height:160px;border-radius:50%;
  background:rgba(99,179,237,.07);pointer-events:none;
}
.report-kicker{
  text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;
  color:rgba(147,197,253,1);margin-bottom:6px;
}
.report-title{font-size:26px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 6px;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.3px}
.report-subtitle{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);max-width:600px;line-height:1.6}
.report-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:4px}
.report-btn{
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);
  color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 16px;
  font-size:12px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;backdrop-filter:blur(4px);
  transition:all .2s ease;white-space:nowrap;
}
.report-btn.primary{
  background:#fff;color:#0f172a;border-color:#fff;
}
.report-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}

/* Cuerpo del reporte */
.report-body{padding:20px 20px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}

/* KPI grid */
.report-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}
.report-stat{
  background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;
  box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(15,23,42,.06);
  border:1px solid var(--report-border);
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.report-stat::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;
  border-radius:14px 14px 0 0;
}
.report-stat.kpi-price::before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#1d4ed8,#3b82f6)}
.report-stat.kpi-range::before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6366f1,#a78bfa)}
.report-stat.kpi-plus::before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#34d399)}
.report-stat.kpi-future::before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d97706,#fbbf24)}
.report-stat .rs-label{font-size:10px;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px}
.report-stat .rs-value{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.1}
.report-stat.kpi-price .rs-value{color:#1d4ed8}
.report-stat.kpi-plus .rs-value{color:#059669}
.report-stat.kpi-future .rs-value{color:#d97706}
.report-stat .rs-note{font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:5px;font-weight:500}

/* Secciones */
.report-section{
  background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--report-border);border-radius:14px;
  padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(15,23,42,.06);
}
.report-section-header{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:13px;
  padding-bottom:11px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f3f6;
}
.report-section-icon{
  width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;font-size:15px;flex-shrink:0;
}
.report-section h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.1px}
.report-section h3 span{display:block;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:1px}

/* Summary text */
.report-summary{
  font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8faff,#f0f4ff);
  border:1px solid #dbeafe;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;
}
.report-summary strong{color:#1d4ed8}

/* Tablas */
.report-two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
.report-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11.5px}
.report-table tr:last-child td,.report-table tr:last-child th{border-bottom:none}
.report-table th,.report-table td{padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f3f6;text-align:left}
.report-table th{font-weight:600;color:#6b7280;background:#f9fafb;font-size:10.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em}
.report-table td{color:#111827;font-weight:500}
.report-table tr:hover td{background:#fafbff}

/* Chart */
.report-chart{min-height:250px}
.report-note{
  font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7280;line-height:1.65;margin-top:10px;
  padding:8px 12px;background:#f9fafb;border-radius:7px;border-left:3px solid #e2e5ea;
}

/* Lectura ejecutiva con iconos */
.exec-points{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.exec-point{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:9px;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #f1f3f6}
.exec-point-icon{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:7px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px}
.exec-point-text strong{display:block;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin-bottom:2px}
.exec-point-text span{font-size:11px;color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6}

/* Footer del reporte */
.report-footer{
  padding:14px 20px;background:#f8f9fb;border-top:1px solid #eaecf0;
  font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;line-height:1.7;
}

/* Divisor de fecha */
.report-datestamp{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px;
}
.report-datestamp-line{flex:1;height:1px;background:#e5e7eb}
.report-datestamp-text{font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase}

.pdf-mode .tabs,.pdf-mode #panel-sistema .location-map-card,.pdf-mode .report-actions{display:none!important}
.pdf-mode .panel{display:block!important}
.pdf-mode #panel-ubicacion{display:none!important}
@media(max-width:850px){.report-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.report-head{flex-direction:column}.report-two{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(max-width:520px){.report-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.report-title{font-size:20px}}

</style>

<h2 class="sr-only">Sistema de apoyo a la decisión inmobiliaria en México. Estima el precio actual de una vivienda y su plusvalía proyectada según la zona, combinando el AVM (MAPE 23.63%) con el índice SHF.</h2>

<div style="padding:.65rem 0 0">
<div class="tabs">
  <button class="tab active" onclick="switchTab('sistema')">Sistema AVM + Plusvalía</button>
  <button class="tab" onclick="switchTab('mapa')">Mapa por estado</button>
  <button class="tab" id="tab-ubicacion" onclick="switchTab('ubicacion')" style="display:none">Mapa de ubicación</button>
  <button class="tab" onclick="switchTab('modelo')">Métricas del modelo</button>
  <button class="tab" onclick="switchTab('tendencia')">Tendencia SHF</button>
  <button class="tab" onclick="switchTab('reporte')">RESULTADOS REPORTE</button>
</div>

<!-- ======== TAB 1: SISTEMA INTEGRADO ======== -->
<div id="panel-sistema" class="panel active">
  <div class="metric-grid">
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">Objetivo del proyecto</div><div class="metric-val" style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.4">AVM + tendencia</div><div class="metric-sub">Sistema de apoyo a la decisión</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">MAPE modelo final</div><div class="metric-val">23.63%</div><div class="metric-sub">Stacking RF+XGBoost</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">R² conjunto prueba</div><div class="metric-val">0.7726</div><div class="metric-sub">77% variabilidad explicada</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">Error tendencia SHF</div><div class="metric-val">6.62%</div><div class="metric-sub">Validación rodante 37 cortes</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">Ubicación de la vivienda</div>
    <div class="coord-row">
      <div style="flex:1"><label>Latitud</label><input type="number" id="lat" placeholder="ej. 19.4326" step="0.0001" value="19.4326"></div>
      <div style="flex:1"><label>Longitud</label><input type="number" id="lon" placeholder="ej. -99.1332" step="0.0001" value="-99.1332"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="loc-indicator" id="loc-ok"><i class="ti ti-map-pin" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span id="loc-zm-name"></span> — zona detectada automáticamente</div>
    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top:4px">
      <div><label>Tipo de propiedad</label>
        <select id="tipo">
          <option value="house">Casa (house)</option>
          <option value="apartment">Departamento (apartment)</option>
          <option value="PH">PH</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div><label>Zona metropolitana más cercana</label>
        <select id="zona">
          <option value="ZM Valle México">ZM Valle de México</option>
          <option value="ZM Guadalajara">ZM Guadalajara</option>
          <option value="ZM Monterrey">ZM Monterrey</option>
          <option value="ZM PueblaTlax">ZM Puebla-Tlaxcala</option>
          <option value="ZM Tijuana">ZM Tijuana</option>
          <option value="ZM León">ZM León</option>
          <option value="ZM Querétaro">ZM Querétaro</option>
          <option value="ZM Toluca">ZM Toluca</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div><label>Superficie cubierta (m²)</label><input type="number" id="sup_cubierta" value="120" min="20" max="1000"></div>
      <div><label>Superficie total (m²)</label><input type="number" id="sup_total" value="150" min="20" max="2000"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-bottom:9px">
      <label>Comercios en radio 500m: <strong id="lbl_c">10</strong></label>
      <input type="range" id="comercio" min="0" max="60" step="1" value="10" oninput="document.getElementById('lbl_c').textContent=this.value">
    </div>
    <div style="margin-bottom:9px">
      <label>Escolaridad promedio AGEB (años): <strong id="lbl_e">12.0</strong></label>
      <input type="range" id="escolaridad" min="4" max="20" step="0.5" value="12" oninput="document.getElementById('lbl_e').textContent=parseFloat(this.value).toFixed(1)">
    </div>
    <button class="btn-primary" onclick="calcularIntegral()">Estimar precio y proyectar plusvalía</button>

    <div class="result-panel" id="result-panel">
      <div class="result-hero">
        <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:4px">Estimación AVM — precio de oferta de referencia</div>
        <div class="result-precio" id="res-precio-hero"></div>
        <div class="result-sub" id="res-intervalo-hero"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="result-grid">
        <div class="result-card val">
          <div class="rc-label">Precio estimado hoy</div>
          <div class="rc-val" id="rc-hoy"></div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-success);margin-top:2px">MAPE ±23.63%</div>
        </div>
        <div class="result-card crec">
          <div class="rc-label">Plusvalía proyectada 1 año</div>
          <div class="rc-val" id="rc-plus"></div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-accent);margin-top:2px" id="rc-tasa-zm"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="result-card warn">
          <div class="rc-label">Precio proyectado 2027</div>
          <div class="rc-val" id="rc-fut"></div>
          <div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-warning);margin-top:2px">Error tendencia ±6.62%</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:var(--surface-1);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:10px 13px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.7">
        <strong style="color:var(--text-primary)">Cómo leer este resultado:</strong><br>
        El precio estimado es una referencia del nivel de la oferta en tu zona — no el precio de transacción cerrada.
        La plusvalía proyectada usa la tasa de crecimiento anual promedio del Índice SHF para la zona metropolitana detectada.
        El intervalo de predicción se construye sobre el MAPE del modelo (±23.63%). No sustituye un avalúo certificado.
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="margin-top:9px;padding:10px 11px">
        <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:7px">Ubicación de la vivienda</div>
        <div id="ubicacion-map" style="width:100%;height:320px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden"></div>
        <div id="map-coord-text" style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:6px"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="warn-box">Estimación sobre precios de oferta Properati. El AVM tiene MAPE 23.63% — para una vivienda de $3M, el error puede ser ±$709k. Úsalo como referencia comparativa, no como valuación formal.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ======== TAB 2: MAPA ======== -->
<div id="panel-mapa" class="panel">
  <div class="metric-grid">
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">Entidades en el mapa</div><div class="metric-val">32</div><div class="metric-sub">20 con MAPE + 12 sin datos</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">Menor error</div><div class="metric-val">11.0%</div><div class="metric-sub">Hidalgo</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">Mayor error</div><div class="metric-val">48.6%</div><div class="metric-sub">Guerrero</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="metric-label">Correlación N–MAPE</div><div class="metric-val">r = 0.07</div><div class="metric-sub">Tamaño ≠ precisión</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">MAPE del AVM por entidad federativa</div>
    <div class="map-toggle">
      <button class="active" id="btn-mape" onclick="setMode('mape')">Error del modelo (MAPE)</button>
      <button id="btn-crec" onclick="setMode('crec')">Crecimiento SHF 2020–2026</button>
    </div>
    <div class="map-wrap">
      <div class="mtooltip" id="mtt"></div>
